+  optional gguf plugin mismatch in this checkout; server continues normally.
+- `[ERROR] vision_final_layernorm ... not documented`: remote-code config
+  docstring warning from the model repo; unrelated.
+- `Your GPU does not have native support for FP4 ... Marlin will be used`:
+  expected for SM90 and exactly the requested NVFP4 path.
